---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
import TagChip from '../../components/TagChip.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<Base title="Who we are | Sitelore" description="Sitelore is built by Tideloc, a small web studio in Wollongong NSW, from first-hand experience running shopping centre operations.">
  <PageIntro tag="Who we are" title="Built by Tideloc, Wollongong" lead="A small web studio in Wollongong, NSW." />
  <section data-section="origin" aria-labelledby="or-h" class="border-b border-rule">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-wrap px-5 sm:px-8 py-14 lg:py-20">
      <TagChip label="Origin" />
      <h2 id="or-h" class="mt-5 text-[38px] sm:text-[56px] lg:text-[76px] xl:text-[88px] leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.02em] max-w-[26ch]">The record-keeping existed because a standard required it. The rest of the asset base had no such record.</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 lg:mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10 border-t-2 border-ink pt-8 text-[19px] leading-[1.5]">
        <p class="lg:col-span-5">Sitelore came out of first-hand experience running shopping centre operations and, before that, fire system maintenance reporting, where the record-keeping existed because a standard required it.</p>
        <p class="lg:col-span-4">The rest of the asset base had no such record. Sitelore is that record.</p>
        <p class="lg:col-span-3 lg:justify-self-end lg:text-right text-ink-2 text-[15px] border-t border-rule pt-4 lg:border-t-0 lg:pt-1">Blake Hutchison, founder.<br />Tideloc, Wollongong NSW.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section data-section="demo-disclosure" aria-labelledby="dd-h" class="bg-card border-b border-rule">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-wrap px-5 sm:px-8 py-14 lg:py-16">
      <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end">
        <h2 id="dd-h" class="lg:col-span-6 text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.015em]">Harbourline Property is invented</h2>
        <p class="lg:col-span-6 text-[17px] leading-[1.5]">The screens on this site come from a working demo with a fictional portfolio, Harbourline Property, and five invented sites: Ridgeway Fair, Marlow Central, Quay Tower, Wattleford Central and Brindle Park. Two of them, Wattleford Central and Brindle Park, are drawn on layouts derived from real centres in OpenStreetMap, with invented names and data. Nothing in the demo belongs to a real property group.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand heading="Sitelore is that record" body="A short call to see whether Sitelore fits your sites, and what capture would look like for one of them." object="plan" />
</Base>
